5,1,1,talk,Kenji,,I worry about the ground shifting. We need to know if the firms can actually finish on time.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,Agreed. A pretty plan that ignores the drainage is just expensive art. Let’s look at the data.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Minato,,I just want to know who will water the flowers every single day. It feels lonely without a team.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Minako,,Drawings lie. I want to see what the last decade of our schemes looks like now.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,"I am quiet, but I hear the silence in the budget. I need to see the upkeep ledger.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Benjamin, do you think the heat readings will tell us if the soil holds?","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Kenji, heat tells us about stress. I’ll check the drainage callouts to see where it fails.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Minato,,I am curious about the volunteer groups. Do they like the quiet corners of the park?,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Minako,,I will look at the condition of works from the earlier programme. Facts over feelings.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,I will also check the terms of the regional habitat fund. It might cover the long-term costs.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Kenji,,I want to see the regional firms tendering for earth-moving. Who is actually capable here?,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,I will also look at the timed counts of weekday crossings. People are the weather here.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Minato,,I will look at the groundskeeping roll. I need to know the names of the people who care.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Minako,,I will also check the record of the eastern avenue planting. It is a good test of longevity.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,"I will stick to the ledger and the fund. The numbers do not lie, unlike the promises.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Kenji,,Let’s see what the ground says. I am ready to dig into the details.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,"I am ready. Logic first, then beauty. Let’s find out what is real.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Minato,,I hope the people are kind. I will look for the gentle hands in the records.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Minako,,"I am calm. I will let the evidence speak. No need for drama, just truth.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,I will sit with the papers. The quiet is where the truth lives. Let us begin.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
